# Real FPGA results over USB UART; demo loads SRAM after opening serial.
Output work/tapes/hex1000-9k.mp4
Output work/tapes/hex1000-9k.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set WaitTimeout 15s
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "just board-calc-demo"
Enter
Wait+Screen /PASS: all three results received from the FPGA./
Sleep 3s
